nit: this re-implements the detection in `get_expert_substitution_spec` (`vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/expert_substitution.py`), which reads the same two keys from the same configs. Calling it keeps the two from drifting (and the `Mapping` import can go):

```suggestion
        from vllm.model_executor.layers.fused_moe.expert_substitution import (
            get_expert_substitution_spec,
        )

        if get_expert_substitution_spec(self) is not None:
            return
```

Also, the `enable_eplb` check at the top of this method repeats the caller's `if parallel_config.enable_eplb:`, and `ParallelConfig` already rejects EPLB without EP, so one of the two can go.

